      "Left truncation: trials enrol people still well enough to qualify, so anyone enrolled years after onset must be a slow progressor. This builds the association in.",
      "Direction: slow disease is diagnosed later (subtle symptoms), so delay mostly marks slow biology; it does not show that diagnosing earlier changes the course."
